(
 'Squashes some commits of the current branch into a single commit.'
 'In case the current branch is "main" or "master" you will be asked for confirmation.'
 ''
 'If no argument is specified all suitable commits will be listed.'
 'By specifying a positive integer you can specify the number of commits to be squashed.'
 ''
 '-m=    You may specify a message with -m="my message", but if you don''t you will be given an edit'
 '       window for specifying a message. It will be populated with the messages from the commits'
 '       about to be squashed.'
)
